  "rationale": "The plant automata G1 models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, separating sensing (uncontrollable events) from motion (controllable events). The specification automata E1 binds sensor outcomes to safe, conservative actions, enforcing immediate turn-based recovery on obstacle detection, and ensuring exploration alternates between random_walk and short forward progress. Obstacle states force deterministic, single-action recovery, and random_walk is only enabled in clear/search states. All transitions are deterministic and total with respect to uncontrollables.",
